# =============================================================================
#  WONDER WOMAN - MAIN MENU IDLE LOOP  ("Amazon Grace")     Roblox R15 / MrXen0 rig
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  HOW TO USE
#    1. Open your MrXen0_R15RIG .blend in Blender (5.0+ recommended).
#    2. Scripting workspace -> Text Editor -> New -> paste this whole file.
#    3. Press  Run Script  (Alt+P).  Done - the armature now has the action
#       "WonderWoman_Idle" assigned and the timeline set to 60 fps, frames 0-360.
#
#  WHAT IT DOES
#    * deletes any old "WonderWoman_Idle" action first (no lingering keyframes)
#    * sets the rig to FK mode (ARM_IK_FK / LEG_IK_FK = 0)
#    * keys ONLY the animated FK controls (full-body loop, so legs/pelvis are keyed)
#    * all curves BEZIER + AUTO_CLAMPED, with a Cycles modifier so the loop seam
#      is smooth (frame 360 == frame 0)
#
#  TIMING (60 fps):   360 frames = 6.0 s - graceful strength, long lines, flowing
#    stance  : narrow, tall stagger (right foot forward and turned out, weight softly on the left leg), hips gently
#              shifted and turned 3/4, chest counter-rotated to the camera = a long S-curve; shoulders relaxed, chin up;
#              left hand rests softly at the waist, small breath every 90 f
#    60-116  : right hand floats off the waist, out into a long line as she takes up the lasso
#    100-240 : LASSO TWIRL - a round, closed circle (~0.45 stud radius, 1.5 Hz): shoulder drives, forearm trails 6 f,
#              wrist trails 12 f like a ribbon; her body answers with a faint S-curve sway; head follows the rope
#    240-292 : the lasso comes home - a wide sweeping arc, the wrist opens in a flourish as the hand lands on her waist
#    262-300 : hair-toss: head tilts back and flows through, chin lifts, a soft chest lift; then a serene look off to the side
#              and back to the camera
#
#  This is a FULL-BODY loop (idle display) - export it as a Looped animation and do
#  NOT apply the upper-body-only bone filter.
# =============================================================================
